claim:
    ? forall f,g fn(x {1,2}) R:
        forall x {1,2}:
            0 <= f(x)
            f(x) <= g(x)
        =>:
            finite_set_product({1,2},f) <= finite_set_product({1,2},g)
    0 <= f(1)
    0 <= f(2)
    f(1) <= g(1)
    f(2) <= g(2)
    finite_set_product({1,2},f) = f(1)*f(2) <= g(1)*g(2) = finite_set_product({1,2},g)
